# Jordan's job search

I am Jordan Reyes. After nine years as a project manager at Northline Logistics, I was made redundant. I want to move into renewable energy, where my experience of running big, complicated projects should count.

The search fits on one line: what I am looking for, the salary I am aiming for, when I started, when I want a job by, my savings, and what I need each month. The app works out that my savings will last just under 4.7 months, and it will warn me if that drops below three.

JobSearch: Project manager in renewable energy|Project Manager|65000|2026-10-05|2027-01-31|15000|3200
